  GAP 2 ✗ — Dashboard Analytics & Sparklines

  Verified state: Zero files match "dashboard", "analytics", "sparkline", "timeSeries", "trend". Statements endpoints return
   current-period snapshots only. The ledger has full transaction history but no aggregation layer over it.

  Frontend impact: Dashboard.vue uses 4 sparklines (SPARK_CASH, SPARK_AR, SPARK_REV, SPARK_EXP) — each is a 12-point monthly
