  GAP 4 ⚠ — Active Session Management

  Verified state: RefreshToken entity already stores userAgent (500 chars), clientIp (45 chars), issuedAt, expiresAt,
  revokedAt. Refresh token rotation is implemented (RFC 6749). POST /logout revokes ALL sessions. Repository has
  findByUserId() and revokeAllByUser(). Only the list/revoke-individual endpoints are missing from the controller.

  What needs building:
  GET  /api/v1/auth/sessions          — list active (non-revoked, non-expired) sessions
  DELETE /api/v1/auth/sessions/{id}   — revoke a specific session (not current)
  POST /api/v1/auth/sessions/revoke-all-others — revoke all except current

  These map directly onto existing repository methods. The Security.vue "This device" indicator needs the current session's
  token ID returned in the /login and /refresh responses.

